# M6.5 acceptance, run 1 of 2: per-file reading position in a saved project.
# Go to p. 40 of long.pdf at a custom 75% and to p. 5 of book/other.pdf at
# Fit Width, switching between them, then quit. Run both runs with
# tests/acceptance/m6.5.sh, which builds the fixture in /tmp/agentic-reader-
# m6.5 (layout at the top of m6.5.sh), a scratch HOME and the M6.2 fake
# sidecar, and checks .reader/project.json after each run. This run is
#   scripts/shot.sh -o <out>/run1 -s tests/acceptance/m6.5.steps -- \
#     env HOME=/tmp/agentic-reader-m6.5/home \
#       READER_SIDECAR_CMD=<worktree>/tests/acceptance/m6.2-fake-sidecar.sh \
#       READER_FAKE_LOG=/tmp/agentic-reader-m6.5/fake-run1.log \
#       ./build/app/agentic-reader /tmp/agentic-reader-m6.5/proj/long.pdf
#
# Interface choices where the spec is silent (the implementer conforms or
# files a TEST DISPUTE):
#   - project.json "files" entries are keyed by the path relative to the
#     project root ("long.pdf", "book/other.pdf"). "last_page" is 0-based
#     (p. 40 is 39). "zoom" is "fit-width", "fit-page", or a custom scale
#     factor as a decimal string ("0.75" for 75%). See the comment at the top
#     of tests/test_reading_position.cpp.
#   - Every save (debounced page change, file switch, leaving a project, app
#     close) writes .reader/project.json at once. A page change is written 1 s
#     after the last page change (a restarted 1 s timer): not yet 0.3 s after
#     it, but by 2 s after it.
#   - Opening a PDF that has an entry restores both: the page's top edge at
#     the top of the pane (as PdfView::goToPage) and the zoom (the fit mode,
#     or the custom scale). A PDF with no entry opens at page 1 and keeps the
#     view's zoom mode, as before M6.5.
#   - Switching files (tree, File > Open, Recent, drop) saves the file being
#     left before the new one opens, so a page change less than 1 s before a
#     switch is not lost.
#   - Unsaved projects keep no reading positions on disk (M6.2 spec 5): no
#     .reader/ is created for them (checked in run 2).
#
# Geometry at 1400x900 (see m2.4.steps and m6.2.steps): menu bar y 0..27,
# toolbar y 28..68 with the zoom combo text at (35,48), Fit Width (148,48),
# Fit Page (234,48), page entry (320,48) and its "/ N" total. Left pane
# (project panel) x 0..220, (110,700) is a blank point in its tree. PDF pane
# x 225..980, y 69..875 (client 755x806), center (600,470). Status bar field 0
# (bottom left) is the open file's name.
# Fit Width of long.pdf (612 pt wide) = (755 - 24) / 612 = 119%. Fit Width of
# other.pdf (300 pt wide) = 731 / 300 = 244%; its Fit Page = (806 - 24) / 500
# = 156%. At 75% a long.pdf page is 459 px wide, centered in the pane.
#
# Tree rows in proj: "book", "other.pdf" (indented under book), "long.pdf".
wait 3

# long.pdf opened from the command line in the saved project proj: header
# "proj", tree book / other.pdf / long.pdf. "Page 1 of 520" at the top of the
# PDF pane at Fit Width (page spans the pane width, combo "119%"), entry
# "1 / 520", status field 0 "long.pdf".
shot start

# Custom zoom 75%, then p. 40 through the page entry.
click 600 500
click 35 48
key ctrl+a
type 75
key Return
wait 1
click 320 48
key ctrl+a
type 40
key Return
# 0.3 s after the page change: not written yet (1 s debounce).
run /tmp/agentic-reader-m6.5/state check-not /tmp/agentic-reader-m6.5/proj long.pdf 39
wait 2
# 2 s later, with no switch and no quit: written, page and zoom.
run /tmp/agentic-reader-m6.5/state check /tmp/agentic-reader-m6.5/proj long.pdf 39 0.75

# long.pdf at p. 40 at 75%: "Page 40 of 520" heading near the top of the PDF
# pane, the page about 459 px wide and centered with grey on both sides,
# combo "75%", entry "40 / 520", status field 0 "long.pdf".
shot long-p40-75

click 110 700
key Home Down Return
wait 3

# The second row, book/other.pdf, is open for the first time: "Chapter 1 of
# 12" at the top of the PDF pane inside a blue border, entry "1 / 12", status
# field 0 "other.pdf". (Its zoom is not checked here: a file with no entry
# keeps the view's zoom.) The tree is unchanged.
shot other-first-open

# Fit Width, p. 3, then switch to long.pdf by a drop about 0.3 s later, well
# inside the 1 s debounce: the switch itself must save other.pdf.
click 148 48
wait 1
click 320 48
key ctrl+a
type 3
key Return
run /tmp/agentic-reader-m6.5/xdnd-drop 600 470 /tmp/agentic-reader-m6.5/proj/long.pdf
wait 3
run /tmp/agentic-reader-m6.5/state check /tmp/agentic-reader-m6.5/proj book/other.pdf 2 fit-width

# Back on long.pdf, its position came back in the same session: "Page 40 of
# 520" heading near the top, page about 459 px wide and centered, combo
# "75%", entry "40 / 520", status field 0 "long.pdf".
shot switched-back-long

click 110 700
key Home Down Return
wait 3

# other.pdf again, at its saved position: "Chapter 3 of 12" heading near the
# top of the PDF pane, the page with its blue border spanning the pane width
# (Fit Width, combo "244%"), entry "3 / 12", status field 0 "other.pdf".
# tests/acceptance/m6.5.sh checks that this shot exists.
shot other-restored

# p. 5, then quit in the same xdotool call (within milliseconds): only the
# save at close can record p. 5 (m6.5.sh checks last_page 4 afterwards).
click 320 48
key ctrl+a
type 5
key Return ctrl+q
wait 3
